      "id": "serran",
      "end": 1599,
      "contributors": [],
      "provenance": "Pleiades",
      "associationCertaintyURI": "https://pleiades.stoa.org/vocabularies/association-certainty/certain",
      "start": 1500,
      "details": "<p><em>Der-\u1e25ud\u016bd-i Filis\u1e6d\u012bn</em><span>:\u00a0It is a large district, within which lie\u00a0</span><em>Beyt\u00fc\u2019l-ma\u1e33dis</em><span>\u00a0(Jerusalem),\u00a0</span><em>\u0120azze</em><span>\u00a0(Gaza), and\u00a0</span><em>\u2018As\u1e33al\u0101n</em><span>\u00a0(Ashkelon).\u00a0Its western boundary runs from\u00a0</span><em>Refa\u1e25</em><span>\u00a0(Rafah) to\u00a0</span><em>Lecc\u016bn</em><span>\u00a0(Legio), and its width is two days\u2019 journey, extending from\u00a0</span><em>Y\u0101f\u0101</em><span>\u00a0(Jaffa) to\u00a0</span><em>Er\u012b\u1e25\u0101</em><span>\u00a0(Jericho).\u00a0At present,\u00a0</span><em>Zu\u0121ar</em><span>, the diy\u0101r-\u0131 L\u016b\u1e6d (the region of Lot, i.e., around the Dead Sea), as well as\u00a0</span><em>Cib\u0101l</em><span>\u00a0and\u00a0</span><em>\u015eerr\u0101n</em><span>\u00a0(the Sharon plain) are all attached to\u00a0</span><em>Filis\u1e6d\u012bn</em><span>\u00a0(Palestine).\u00a0Its water comes from rainfall, except in\u00a0</span><em>N\u0101blus</em><span>\u00a0(Nablus), where there is running water.\u00a0And the great cities of this\u00a0</span><em>\u2018\u00f6rf\u012b</em><span>\u00a0(customary administrative) district are\u00a0</span><em>Beyt-i Ma\u1e33dis</em><span>\u00a0(Jerusalem),\u00a0</span><em>\u0120azze</em><span>\u00a0(Gaza), and\u00a0</span><em>Remle</em><span>\u00a0(Ramla).\u00a0All\u0101h knows the best. [translation]</span></p>",
      "review_state": "published",
      "description": "",
